Package: AmpliPub
Title: Publication-Grade Statistics and Figures for Amplicon Sequencing Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Bharat", "Manna",
           email = "bharatmanna@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Statistical analysis and figure generation for amplicon sequencing
    data (16S, 18S, ITS), starting from an abundance table and sample metadata.
    Runs the tests that peer review expects, checks the assumptions those tests
    depend on, reports results across multiple methods rather than a single one,
    and produces figures that are ready to submit. Pipeline-agnostic: accepts
    output from QIIME 2, DADA2, mothur, or any source that yields a feature
    table.
biocViews: Microbiome, Sequencing, Software, DifferentialExpression
